  (
    [Gandhi single-handedly demarcated the international boundary line between India and Pakistan in Bengal],
    [Gandhi commanded a private army of nationalist volunteers that guarded the refugee camps along the Punjab border],
    [Gandhi's moral presence and heroic peace fasts quelled communal violence in Bengal where 55,000 soldiers had failed in Punjab],
    [Gandhi successfully persuaded the Muslim League and Congress to sign the Mountbatten Plan without partition],
  )
)

